# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Multi-person support
#  Wraps the existing single-person solve in a per-person loop. Each person gets
#  an ISOLATED copy of every temporal filter (One Euro, leg IK, occlusion, gate,
#  lookahead, bone-length, root) so persons can't cross-contaminate each other's
#  smoothing. Output channels are prefixed p1_/p2_/... when Multiperson is ON;
#  with it OFF, _active_person_prefix stays '' and channel names are unchanged.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

